{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1743-p2","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《广州三月二十九革命史》（民智书局1926 年版）。林觉民（1887—1911），字意洞，号抖飞，又号天外生，福建闽县（今福州）人，民主革命者，黄花岗七十二烈士之一。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔意映卿卿如晤〕意思如同“我妻见字如面”。意映，作者妻子的名字。卿卿，旧时夫对妻的爱称。如晤，如同见面，旧时书信用语。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔竟〕完成。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔彀〕同“够”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔司马春衫〕语出唐白居易《琵琶行》：“座中泣下谁最多？江州司马青衫湿。”这里比喻极度悲伤。春衫，应为“青衫”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔太上之忘情〕古人有“太上忘情”之说，意思是修养最高的人，忘了喜怒哀乐之情。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔充〕扩充。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔与使〕与其。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔无宁〕不如。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔有身〕有身孕。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔寸管〕指笔。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔第〕只是。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔抑〕还是。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔骨化石〕古代传说，有一男子外出未归，其妻天天登山远望，日久天长变成了一块石头。后人称之为“望夫石”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔率性〕任性。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔依新〕作者的儿子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔肖〕像。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔旁（bàng）〕靠近。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔的的（dídí）〕实在，的确。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔偶〕婚配，嫁给。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔巾〕这封信写在一条白布方巾上，故云。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔模拟〕想象，揣摩。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-22"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔一恸〕大恸。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-23"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔辛未〕应是“辛亥”，即1911 年。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-24"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔念〕俗同“廿”，二十。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-25"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔四鼓〕四更天。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-26"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔诸母〕各位伯母、叔母。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11192-27"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"福州林觉民故居的林觉民烈士塑像","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"与妻书","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11192-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"\n\n林觉民","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"意映卿卿如晤","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11192-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，吾今以此书与汝永别矣！吾作此书时，尚是世中一人；汝看此书时，吾已成为阴间一鬼。吾作此书，泪珠和笔墨齐下，不能竟","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11192-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"书而欲搁笔，又恐汝不察吾衷，谓吾忍舍汝而死，谓吾不知汝之不欲吾死也，故遂忍悲为汝言之。\n\n吾至爱汝，即此爱汝一念，使吾勇于就死也。吾自遇汝以来，常愿天下有情人都成眷属；然遍地腥云，满街狼犬，称心快意，几家能彀","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11192-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？司马春衫","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11192-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，吾不能学太上之忘情","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11192-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也。语云：仁者“老吾老，以及人之老；幼吾幼，以及人之幼”。吾充","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11192-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"吾爱汝之心，助天下人爱其所爱，所以敢先汝而死，不顾汝也。汝体吾此心，于啼泣之余，亦以天下人为念，当亦乐牺牲吾身与汝身之福利，为天下人谋永福也。汝其勿悲！\n\n汝忆否？四五年前某夕，吾尝语曰：“与使","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11192-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"吾先死也，无宁","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11192-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"汝先吾而死。”汝初闻言而怒，后经吾婉解，虽不谓吾言为是，而亦无词相答。吾之意盖谓以汝之弱，必不能禁失吾之悲，吾先死，留苦与汝，吾心不忍，故宁请汝先死，吾担悲也。嗟夫！谁知吾卒先汝而死乎？\n\n吾真真不能忘汝也！回忆后街之屋，入门穿廊，过前后厅，又三四折，有小厅，厅旁一室，为吾与汝双栖之所。初婚三四个月，适冬之望日前后，窗外疏梅筛月影，依稀掩映；吾与并肩携手，低低切切，何事不语？何情不诉？及今思之，空余泪痕。又回忆六七年前，吾之逃家复归也，汝泣告我：“望今后有远行，必以告妾，妾愿随君行。”吾亦既许汝矣。前十余日回家，即欲乘便以此行之事语汝，及与汝相对，又不能启口，且以汝之有身","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11192-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也，更恐不胜悲，故惟日日呼酒买醉。嗟夫！当时余心之悲，盖不能以寸管","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11192-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"形容之。\n\n吾诚愿与汝相守以死，第","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-11192-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"以今日事势观之，天灾可以死，盗贼可以死，瓜分之日可以死，奸官污吏虐民可以死，吾辈处今日之中国，国中无地无时不可以死。到那时使吾眼睁睁看汝死，或使汝眼睁睁看吾死，吾能之乎？抑","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-11192-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"汝能之乎？即可不死，而离散不相见，徒使两地眼成穿而骨化石","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-11192-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，试问古来几曾见破镜能重圆？则较死为苦也，将奈之何？今日吾与汝幸双健。天下人之不当死而死与不愿离而离者，不可数计，钟情如我辈者，能忍之乎？此吾所以敢率性","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-11192-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"就死不顾汝也。吾今死无余憾，国事成不成自有同志者在。依新","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-11192-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"已五岁，转眼成人，汝其善抚之，使之肖","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-11192-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"我。汝腹中之物，吾疑其女也，女必像汝，吾心甚慰。或又是男，则亦教其以父志为志，则吾死后尚有二意洞在也。甚幸，甚幸！吾家后日当甚贫，贫无所苦，清静过日而已。\n\n吾今与汝无言矣。吾居九泉之下遥闻汝哭声，当哭相和也。吾平日不信有鬼，今则又望其真有。今人又言心电感应有道，吾亦望其言是实，则吾之死，吾灵尚依依旁","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-11192-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"汝也，汝不必以无侣悲。\n\n吾平生未尝以吾所志语汝，是吾不是处；然语之，又恐汝日日为吾担忧。吾牺牲百死而不辞，而使汝担忧，的的","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-11192-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"非吾所忍。吾爱汝至，所以为汝谋者惟恐未尽。汝幸而偶","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-11192-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"我，又何不幸而生今日之中国！吾幸而得汝，又何不幸而生今日之中国！卒不忍独善其身。嗟夫！巾","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-11192-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"短情长，所未尽者，尚有万千，汝可以模拟","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-11192-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"得之。吾今不能见汝矣！\n\n汝不能舍吾，其时时于梦中得我乎？一恸","type":"text"},{"label":"[23]","noteId":"footnote-11192-23","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。辛未","type":"text"},{"label":"[24]","noteId":"footnote-11192-24","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"三月念","type":"text"},{"label":"[25]","noteId":"footnote-11192-25","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"六夜四鼓","type":"text"},{"label":"[26]","noteId":"footnote-11192-26","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，意洞手书。\n\n家中诸母","type":"text"},{"label":"[27]","noteId":"footnote-11192-27","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"皆通文，有不解处，望请其指教，当尽吾意为幸。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"这两篇文章均名为“书”，却是不同的文体。一为随事谏诤、议论政务的奏疏，一为传寄亲人、吐露心声的书信。对象不同，目的各异，要反复诵读，认真体会二者在态度、语气、表达方式、语体选择上的差异。\n\n奏疏一类公文，往往针对具体政事阐发观点，务求实效，因而要精心构思，巧妙措辞，选取恰切的立足点和切入点。李斯作《谏逐客书》，针对秦王驱逐客卿的政令发表意见，意在劝说君王收回成命。为了达到这一目的，作者站在“跨海内，制诸侯”的高度看待逐客的利弊得失，历数秦国过去因任用客卿而逐渐富强的史实，切中了秦王一统天下的雄心，最终成功打动秦王。文章铺张扬厉，气势雄浑，颇有战国策士的论辩之风。\n\n亲友之间的书信，往往不事营构，自由抒写，自有一种打动人心的力量。林觉民作《与妻书》，与妻诀别，倾诉衷肠，一面表达对妻子的至爱，或直抒胸臆，或追忆往昔，一面又冲破儿女情长，晓以国家大义，时时作解释和安慰。“吾至爱汝”的深情与“即此爱汝一念，使吾勇于就死”的勇决，宛如两种旋律交错并进，使文章既缠绵悱恻，又充满浩然正气。\n\n诵读课文，注意把握感情线索，体会作者写作时的复杂心理和崇高的思想境界。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":322425,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/9/98495bdc31456a319088c2f8f8da4bde9a9cde10.jpeg","height":725,"id":"media-0bb8afce3268a5f6cc5a","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"6017c13003eabd9ae8aaa8d94c9d5d4dfb4ba1c54e467c5fa7e1d080ae8f1a17","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/9/98495bdc31456a319088c2f8f8da4bde9a9cde10.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":967}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11192-2","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/9/98495bdc31456a319088c2f8f8da4bde9a9cde10.jpeg","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/9/98495bdc31456a319088c2f8f8da4bde9a9cde10.jpeg","text":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/9/98495bdc31456a319088c2f8f8da4bde9a9cde10.jpeg","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-1","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-2","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-3","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-4","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-5","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-6","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-7","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-8","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-9","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-9","text":"[9]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-10","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-10","text":"[10]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-11","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-11","text":"[11]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-12","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-12","text":"[12]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-13","postId":"11192-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11192-13","